    CPOS-E-002,E-003,E-007,E-008,E-009,E-010: Fix HA Ingress static mount under Starlette >=0.33 and harden scanner pipeline
    
    Ledger IDs: E-002, E-003, E-007, E-008, E-009, E-010
    - Normalize X-Ingress-Path and prefix scope['path'] in IngressMiddleware so Starlette >=0.33 StaticFiles Mount('/ui/static') strips root_path and returns 200 OK; mount UI static/router in create_app.
    - Update scanner_service/web/views.py to use TemplateResponse(request=..., name=..., context=...) with fallback HTML renderer when jinja2 is absent.
    - Exclude delisted historical symbols from _pick_next_symbol fundamental queue to prevent infinite starvation livelock while including pushed watchlist symbols; record failure cooldown when evaluate_symbol returns False.
    - Route sp500_scanner.fetch_sp500_universe and standalone evaluate_symbol through TokenBucket/YFGateway and fall back to cached ticker_map rows on Wikipedia scrape failure.
    - Add regression tests in compounderos_app/test_scanner_service.py.

